flowchart TD
 A[Simulated employee access report] --> B[Verify Entra account enabled]
 B --> C[Review role and group assignments]
 C --> D[Inspect app-specific sign-in events]
 D --> E{Authentication error?}
 E -->|Yes| F[Investigate error code, MFA, Conditional Access]
 E -->|No or unknown| G[Review license and service plans]
 F --> H[Validate affected workload]
 G --> H
 H --> I{User access verified?}
 I -->|Yes| J[Document approved fix and close]
 I -->|No| K[Escalate with evidence; keep ticket open]
